00:06:24.247 --> 00:06:25.950
- It's like four to 12 players

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:29.910
and so I said why not make a
party game for just one person.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:30.960
It's called Box One.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:34.790
It's created just by me and
it's only for one person.

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:36.520
It's not something you
play with your spouse,

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.738
it's not something you play
with a group of people.

00:06:38.738 --> 00:06:40.070
- [Kelly] Solitaire.
- If you like the codes

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.695
and the puzzles and in sort
of escape room adjacent.

00:06:43.695 --> 00:06:46.170
- (gasps) I love escape rooms.

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.240
- I definitely suggest this for you.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.880
I love escape rooms!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.670
Dude, I can't get enough of them

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:52.590
and it's one of the things

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:56.440
that I am so bummed about
all this pandemic nonsense

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.580
is that you can't go to escape rooms

00:06:58.580 --> 00:06:59.520
as much as before.
- Oh my gosh

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.640
I am obsessed with them.
- They're the best.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.800
- It's so clever, it's
such a clever thing.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:04.633
Okay, at some point

00:07:04.633 --> 00:07:05.980
when we're allowed to
be around humans again

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:06.813
and they start that up

00:07:06.813 --> 00:07:08.460
we need to do an escape room together.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.293
- I would love to.

00:07:09.293 --> 00:07:10.630
In the meantime, I recommend Box One

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.770
but only when you're by yourself.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:12.915
- Okay, I love that.
- You can come out

